  {
    "file": "QEND",
    "id": 942691665,
    "en": "At last, Vendral is dead. Juleck's prophecy is complete: Ardania's wisest mind shall unite its strongest bodies and, with magic-forged steel, forever rid our skies of the Winged Death. ",
    "deployed": "    ",
    "source": "gpltext"
  },
  {
    "file": "QEND",
    "id": 875648337,
    "en": "A costly battle, your Highness! But a battle well-fought. None knew the true power of the Liche Queen until we'd forced her from her lair. Given that, this has been an outstanding day! There'd be more",
    "deployed": "    ",
    "source": "gpltext"
